# "When Tinybones Joins Up enters, any number of target players each discard a card." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and targets
# only Bot2 (the slot takes any number, so leaving itself out is legal): Bot2 discards a card of its choice, Bot1 discards
# nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Tinybones Joins Up
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mountain
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tinybones Joins Up.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Mountain)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Tinybones Joins Up
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot2.Graveyard = Mountain
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
